{"id":"vod_sn_39022","vodId":"39022","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"Q弟侦探因幡","name_cn":"Q弟侦探因幡","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1c1303bce509c852c3f405f7c09ceac7.jpg"},"summary":"因幡洋（取访部顺一 配音）的前身是一只警犬，经过特殊途径被繁殖出来的他拥有着近似于人类的外表以及野兽般灵敏的直觉和动作。目前，因幡洋经营着他自己的事务所，担任私家侦探的职务，而他所作的这一切只有一个目的——找到自己失踪的弟弟因幡遥（斋贺弥月 配音）。　　在老搭档荻野邦治（森川智之 配音）的影响下，洋莫名其妙的被卷入了意大利黑手党的纠纷之中，为了根除他们控制日本的庞大野心，洋带着他的两个年轻助手野崎圭（入野自由 配音）和佐佐木优太（下田麻美 配音），同荻野一起与罪恶的瓦伦蒂诺家族展开了斗争。与此同时，在黑手党组织里，洋意外的发现了弟弟的行踪，这背后究竟隐藏了怎样的阴谋呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NC0feQSDhk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uvJEdh7i6Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c3nPSCKdpX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CnA8w2MC1S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HCbN34rUiM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5cWhQt6bMu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/euth2JSV6D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zqzxLQE7pP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/m42h2Sv01d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qpb6GCszyD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CTCueDjx241/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SXc22BUR211/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:51.491Z"}